{"parse":{"title":"测试情报：5A景区「铃兰之丘」欢迎您","pageid":212,"revid":1972,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E6%83%85%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%9A5A%E6%99%AF%E5%8C%BA%E3%80%8C%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%98%E3%80%8D%E6%AC%A2%E8%BF%8E%E6%82%A8&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E6%83%85%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%9A5A%E6%99%AF%E5%8C%BA%E3%80%8C%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%98%E3%80%8D%E6%AC%A2%E8%BF%8E%E6%82%A8&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E6%83%85%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%9A5A%E6%99%AF%E5%8C%BA%E3%80%8C%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%98%E3%80%8D%E6%AC%A2%E8%BF%8E%E6%82%A8&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98\" title=\"专题\">专题</a> &gt; <b>测试情报：5A景区「铃兰之丘」欢迎您</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E6.B5.8B.E8.AF.95.E6.83.85.E6.8A.A5.EF.BD.9C5A.E6.99.AF.E5.8C.BA.E3.80.8C.E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E4.B8.98.E3.80.8D.E6.AC.A2.E8.BF.8E.E6.82.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"测试情报｜5A景区「铃兰之丘」欢迎您\">测试情报｜5A景区「铃兰之丘」欢迎您</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E6%83%85%E6%8A%A5%EF%BC%9A5A%E6%99%AF%E5%8C%BA%E3%80%8C%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%98%E3%80%8D%E6%AC%A2%E8%BF%8E%E6%82%A8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：测试情报｜5A景区「铃兰之丘」欢迎您\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：只想下班的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2022-03-04 11:36<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FK_lh4nDlKvUHHm0uv5LIJQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/K_lh4nDlKvUHHm0uv5LIJQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<center>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"border-color:#99cc66; width:95%; background-color:#ffffff\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border-color:#ffffff; color:#99cc66\"><center>「起着测试」现已开启招募</center>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:0px; height:320px\"><center><img alt=\"官方消息41.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d0/alrdyib0mdlrbwa0a8xwjuyzyrrayx4.png/500px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF41.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d0/alrdyib0mdlrbwa0a8xwjuyzyrrayx4.png/750px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF41.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d0/alrdyib0mdlrbwa0a8xwjuyzyrrayx4.png/1000px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF41.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"608\" /></center>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</center>\n<p><br />\n各位团长好！<br />\n你们的小场记他来了！他带着最新情报来了！<br />\n自上次发布了测试预告，看团长们对我的呼声很高，那我当然不能辜负大家的期望。<br />\n在跟制作人一番软磨硬泡后，他终于答应让我来偷跑 爆料这次「起着测试」的相关内容，<br />\n嘻嘻，这不我今又从美术大佬那拿到了我们最新的场景和演出。<br />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><small><small>------------------------------</small></small><img alt=\"铃兰花.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5c/c9v827oic8pr6h30u33hunhp6yj2hge.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /><small><small>------------------------------</small></small><br /><br />\n<big><font color=\"#006600\"><b>「铃兰之丘」被评为小镇5A景区</b></font></big></center>\n<p><br /><br />\n我们游戏起名为《铃兰之剑》，原因之一就是这处因盛开铃兰花而闻名的铃兰之丘。这里也是重要剧情发生地，最被熟知的就是“*****”（因涉嫌剧透系统已自动屏蔽）。\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息42.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/af/57bvoua72i6ya9k693w0m3j22hlx23o.png/540px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF42.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"540\" height=\"239\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/af/57bvoua72i6ya9k693w0m3j22hlx23o.png/810px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF42.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/af/57bvoua72i6ya9k693w0m3j22hlx23o.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"478\" /></center><br />\n<p>在此基础上美术又进行了（地理&amp;剧情）的延伸和拓展，「铃兰之丘」也从景点上升到了景区。起着测试PV中歌洛莉亚那段夜戏拍摄地「陵园」就属于铃兰之丘风景区内。\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息43.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3f/pw5rcxq5qvj4buwolcnqel35mst7prs.gif/540px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF43.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"540\" height=\"239\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3f/pw5rcxq5qvj4buwolcnqel35mst7prs.gif 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"354\" />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<img alt=\"官方消息44.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f6/29tdlfzgajfiztlwdsy6txh4qhojh9u.gif/540px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF44.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"540\" height=\"254\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f6/29tdlfzgajfiztlwdsy6txh4qhojh9u.gif 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"376\" /></center>\n<p><small>▲陵园雨天</small>\n<br /><br />\n在游戏中，团长们可以步入陵园，沿着春色盎然的小路，漫步到铃兰之丘，将整个小镇尽收眼底。\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息45.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fa/4l0swmyu6y8zihzz483peiq9zn6ztsi.png/540px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF45.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"540\" height=\"239\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/fa/4l0swmyu6y8zihzz483peiq9zn6ztsi.png/810px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF45.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/fa/4l0swmyu6y8zihzz483peiq9zn6ztsi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"478\" /></center>\n<p><small>▲陵园俯瞰图</small>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息46.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/56/k03abfsf6xyicc07xxhh7470op6aazn.png/540px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF46.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"540\" height=\"239\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/56/k03abfsf6xyicc07xxhh7470op6aazn.png/810px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF46.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/56/k03abfsf6xyicc07xxhh7470op6aazn.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"478\" /></center>\n<p><small>▲铃兰之丘</small>\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><small><small>------------------------------</small></small><img alt=\"铃兰花.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5c/c9v827oic8pr6h30u33hunhp6yj2hge.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /><small><small>------------------------------</small></small><br /><br />\n<big><font color=\"#006600\"><b>铁匠铺升级啦！</b></font></big></center>\n<p><br /><br />\n体验过篝火测试的团长肯定对锻造不陌生，毕竟“全村最好的剑”（字面意思）就是在这里诞生！<br />\n新的铁匠铺场景格局变得更大了，而且功能也变得更多了～<br />\n</p>\n<br /><center><img alt=\"官方消息47.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/gfbn2wbqxmqyrl8xo31odg41mmk0vab.png/540px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF47.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"540\" height=\"239\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/gfbn2wbqxmqyrl8xo31odg41mmk0vab.png/810px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF47.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/04/gfbn2wbqxmqyrl8xo31odg41mmk0vab.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"478\" /></center>\n<p><br />以下，因涉嫌剧透，如果不想被剧透。可以右上角×了。<br />\n没预约游戏的，请先预约一下↓<br />\n</p>\n<br /><center><img alt=\"官方消息48.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/05/5ekeoijcgpyeeorphrc1i7r80yiikjr.png/120px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF48.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/05/5ekeoijcgpyeeorphrc1i7r80yiikjr.png/180px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF48.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/05/5ekeoijcgpyeeorphrc1i7r80yiikjr.png/240px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF48.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></center>\n<p><br />什么，你不怕被剧透？<br />\n好吧，那请继续往下看。<br />\n↓↓\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><small><small>------------------------------</small></small><img alt=\"铃兰花.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5c/c9v827oic8pr6h30u33hunhp6yj2hge.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" data-file-width=\"32\" data-file-height=\"32\" /><small><small>------------------------------</small></small><br /><br />\n<big><font color=\"#006600\"><b>演出新场景路透</b></font></big></center>\n<p><br /><br />\n<b>【港口】</b>——“平静的海面之下似乎暗流涌动”～\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息49.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a5/ooflezluh5v4vjfcyl6t11o2pswb6ow.gif/540px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF49.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"540\" height=\"254\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a5/ooflezluh5v4vjfcyl6t11o2pswb6ow.gif 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"376\" /></center>\n<p><br />【玩具屋】——“什么是快乐童年？”♬ \n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方消息50.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e9/jm0nof7lb2nyknne60n0jxyukvozais.png/540px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF50.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"540\" height=\"239\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e9/jm0nof7lb2nyknne60n0jxyukvozais.png/810px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF50.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e9/jm0nof7lb2nyknne60n0jxyukvozais.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"478\" /></center>\n<p><br /><br />\n糟糕，，<br />\n刚才编剧大大就从我身边走过，，，<br />\n不敢再多加描述了，请团长们自行脑洞。\n<br /><br />\n那就先到这啦，更多起着测试相关的情报，请认准【只想下班的小场记】\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center><img alt=\"官方二维码.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4a/a513m9t3pnx0i3wobn6d2x1842m1v9r.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"928\" height=\"390\" data-file-width=\"928\" data-file-height=\"390\" /></center>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021200504\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.095 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 91/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2617/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 280/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.163      1 -total\n 66.41%   26.008      1 模板:面包屑\n 33.25%   13.022      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:212-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261021200504 and revision id 1972. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"专题"}],"images":["官方消息41.png","铃兰花.png","官方消息42.png","官方消息43.gif","官方消息44.gif","官方消息45.png","官方消息46.png","官方消息47.png","官方消息48.png","官方消息49.gif","官方消息50.png","官方二维码.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"测试情报｜5A景区「铃兰之丘」欢迎您","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"测试情报：5A景区「铃兰之丘」欢迎您","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"测试情报｜5A景区「铃兰之丘」欢迎您"}],"displaytitle":"测试情报：5A景区「铃兰之丘」欢迎您","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|专题}}\n=测试情报｜5A景区「铃兰之丘」欢迎您=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=专题\n|时间=2022-03-04 11:36\n|作者=只想下班的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/K_lh4nDlKvUHHm0uv5LIJQ\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<center>\n{|class=\"wikitable\" style=\"border-color:#99cc66; width:95%; background-color:#ffffff\"\n|style=\"border-color:#ffffff; color:#99cc66\"|<center>「起着测试」现已开启招募</center>\n|-\n|style=\"border:0px; height:320px\"|<center>[[file:官方消息41.png|500px|link=]]</center>\n|}\n</center>\n<br>\n各位团长好！<br>\n你们的小场记他来了！他带着最新情报来了！<br>\n自上次发布了测试预告，看团长们对我的呼声很高，那我当然不能辜负大家的期望。<br>\n在跟制作人一番软磨硬泡后，他终于答应让我来偷跑 爆料这次「起着测试」的相关内容，<br>\n嘻嘻，这不我今又从美术大佬那拿到了我们最新的场景和演出。<br>\n<br><br>\n<center><small><small>------------------------------</small></small>[[file:铃兰花.png|link=]]<small><small>------------------------------</small></small><br><br>\n<big><font color=#006600>'''「铃兰之丘」被评为小镇5A景区</font></big></center>\n<br><br>\n我们游戏起名为《铃兰之剑》，原因之一就是这处因盛开铃兰花而闻名的铃兰之丘。这里也是重要剧情发生地，最被熟知的就是“*****”（因涉嫌剧透系统已自动屏蔽）。\n<br><br>\n<center>[[file:官方消息42.png|540px|link=]]</center><br>\n在此基础上美术又进行了（地理&剧情）的延伸和拓展，「铃兰之丘」也从景点上升到了景区。起着测试PV中歌洛莉亚那段夜戏拍摄地「陵园」就属于铃兰之丘风景区内。\n<br><br>\n<center>[[file:官方消息43.gif|540px|link=]]\n<br>\n[[file:官方消息44.gif|540px|link=]]</center>\n<small>▲陵园雨天</small>\n<br><br>\n在游戏中，团长们可以步入陵园，沿着春色盎然的小路，漫步到铃兰之丘，将整个小镇尽收眼底。\n<br><br>\n<center>[[file:官方消息45.png|540px|link=]]</center>\n<small>▲陵园俯瞰图</small>\n<br><br>\n<center>[[file:官方消息46.png|540px|link=]]</center>\n<small>▲铃兰之丘</small>\n<br><br>\n<center><small><small>------------------------------</small></small>[[file:铃兰花.png|link=]]<small><small>------------------------------</small></small><br><br>\n<big><font color=#006600>'''铁匠铺升级啦！</font></big></center>\n<br><br>\n体验过篝火测试的团长肯定对锻造不陌生，毕竟“全村最好的剑”（字面意思）就是在这里诞生！<br>\n新的铁匠铺场景格局变得更大了，而且功能也变得更多了～<br>\n<br><center>[[file:官方消息47.png|540px|link=]]</center>\n<br>以下，因涉嫌剧透，如果不想被剧透。可以右上角×了。<br>\n没预约游戏的，请先预约一下↓<br>\n<br><center>[[file:官方消息48.png|120px|link=]]</center>\n<br>什么，你不怕被剧透？<br>\n好吧，那请继续往下看。<br>\n↓↓\n<br><br>\n<center><small><small>------------------------------</small></small>[[file:铃兰花.png|link=]]<small><small>------------------------------</small></small><br><br>\n<big><font color=#006600>'''演出新场景路透</font></big></center>\n<br><br>\n'''【港口】'''——“平静的海面之下似乎暗流涌动”～\n<br><br>\n<center>[[file:官方消息49.gif|540px|link=]]</center>\n<br>【玩具屋】——“什么是快乐童年？”♬ \n<br><br>\n<center>[[file:官方消息50.png|540px|link=]]</center>\n<br><br>\n糟糕，，<br>\n刚才编剧大大就从我身边走过，，，<br>\n不敢再多加描述了，请团长们自行脑洞。\n<br><br>\n那就先到这啦，更多起着测试相关的情报，请认准【只想下班的小场记】\n<br><br>\n<center>[[file:官方二维码.png|link=]]</center>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:35:02.024206+00:00"}